@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@phone = 13800138000
@code = 替换为Redis中的6位验证码
@token = 替换为登录返回的Token
@password = 替换为8到64位密码
@orderId = 替换为预约返回的订单ID

### 1. 生成验证码
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/code?phone={{phone}}

### 2. 验证码登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "code": "{{code}}"
}

### 3. 查询是否已经设置密码
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/password/status
authorization: {{token}}

### 4. 首次设置密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/password
Content-Type: application/json
authorization: {{token}}

{
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 5. 手机号密码登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/login/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "{{phone}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 6. 查询演出 1 的票档
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket/of/event/1

### 7. 预约票档 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/reserve/1
authorization: {{token}}

### 8. 查询我的订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/me?current=1&size=10
authorization: {{token}}

### 9A. 模拟支付（与取消二选一）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/pay/{{orderId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 9B. 取消订单（与支付二选一）
POST {{baseUrl}}/ticket-orders/cancel/{{orderId}}
authorization: {{token}}

### 10. 退出登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/logout
authorization: {{token}}
